From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James Nguyen <tienthong2004@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 05:24:16 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] imsmanager: Fall back to the precise data connection
 action string

TelephonyManagerExt reads TelephonyManager's hidden
ACTION_PRECISE_DATA_CONNECTION_STATE_CHANGED by reflection. Android 12
removed that constant, so the field ends up null and
RegistrationManagerBase.<init> crashes in IntentFilter.addAction(null).
Use the action string when reflection finds nothing.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 smali/com/sec/ims/extensions/TelephonyManagerExt.smali | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali/com/sec/ims/extensions/TelephonyManagerExt.smali b/smali/com/sec/ims/extensions/TelephonyManagerExt.smali
index 29d52d2..b3dfc41 100644
--- a/smali/com/sec/ims/extensions/TelephonyManagerExt.smali
+++ b/smali/com/sec/ims/extensions/TelephonyManagerExt.smali
@@ -80,6 +80,11 @@
 
     check-cast v0, Ljava/lang/String;
 
+    if-nez v0, :cond_0
+
+    const-string v0, "android.intent.action.PRECISE_DATA_CONNECTION_STATE_CHANGED"
+
+    :cond_0
     sput-object v0, Lcom/sec/ims/extensions/TelephonyManagerExt;->ACTION_PRECISE_DATA_CONNECTION_STATE_CHANGED:Ljava/lang/String;
 
     .line 82
